# One cell of a 3x3 board. Drawn at 2x to fill an 80px cell.
#
# Lit from above per STYLE.md: the bright face is the top two rows and the
# shadow the bottom three, with no left/right bias — which is what lets the
# same tile shape read on both halves of the screen.
#
# The inset rectangle is why this is a sprite and not a filled rectangle: at 2x
# it gives the grid a lip to catch the light, so nine of them read as a floor
# rather than as nine flat swatches.
name battlegrid-panel-player
size 40 40
key o outline
key h cyan-2
key b cyan-1
key s cyan-0-shadow
pixels
oooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooo
*2 ohhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhho
obbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbo
obbbssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssbbbo
